etails on each segment. for example, CPU, GPU and AI accelerator, which one is more -- what kind of percentage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q4-2021-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2021 Q4","e":"tsm","d":"2022-01-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Charlie Chan","x":"So may I know that -- those price hike benefit mostly reflected in 1Q?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q4-2021-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2021 Q4","e":"tsm","d":"2022-01-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Charlie Chan","x":"Or there will be still some price hike benefits in the second quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q4-2021-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2022-07-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"For example, the number of CPUs, GPUs, and AI accelerators in the data center are increasing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/14/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2022-07-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Laura Chen","x":"And considering your capex discipline and the consistent delivery in advanced node or maybe price hike as well, can we expect that will have more upside to your current 53% gross margin target?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/14/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2022-07-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Frank Lee","x":"It seems like this year, we start to see a foundry price increase and a bit unusual for TSMC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/14/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2022-07-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Liu","x":"And we are still working on the government subsidy and we'll continue working on the cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/14/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q3","e":"tsm","d":"2022-10-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Frank Lee","x":"I know I can't comment too specifically, but you have seen some price increases in the last 12 months or so.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/13/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q3-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q3","e":"tsm","d":"2022-10-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wendell Huang","x":"As a reminder, six factors determined TSMC's profitability, leadership technology development and ramp up, pricing, cost reduction, capacity utilization, technology mix and foreign exchange rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/13/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q3-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2022 Q4","e":"tsm","d":"2023-01-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mehdi Hosseini","x":"So, your cost-cutting efforts must have been greatly exceeding these trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/01/12/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q4-2022-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2023-07-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"With using CPUs, GPUs, or AI accelerator and related ASIC for AI and machine learning, the commonality is that it requires use of leading-edge technology and a strong foundry design ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/20/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2023-07-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"Today, server AI processor demand, which we define as CPUs, GPUs, and AI accelerators that are performing, training, and influence functions accounts for approximately 6% of TSMC's total revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/20/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2023-07-20","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Charlie Chan","x":"I think the more important one should be the first part of the question, especially investors are concerned whether AI is cannibalizing the CPU server demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/20/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q2-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q3","e":"tsm","d":"2023-10-19","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"Whether customer developed the CPU, GPU, AI accelerator, or ASIC for all the type for AI applications, the commonality is that they all require usage of leading-edge technology with stable yield delivery to support larger die size and a strong foundry design ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/19/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q3-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q3","e":"tsm","d":"2023-10-19","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"But all we know or our fundamental rule is whether customer develop the CPU, GPU, AI accelerator or ASIC for their own application or for any purpose in the AI area, we will support them, actually.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/19/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q3-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q3","e":"tsm","d":"2023-10-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wendell Huang","x":"As a reminder, six factors determine TSMC's profitability: leadership, technology development and ramp-up pricing, cost reduction, capacity utilization, technology mix, and foreign exchange rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/19/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q3-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2023 Q4","e":"tsm","d":"2024-01-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"And actually, we see -- today, they say that the component, the total value in the AI, the whole AI data center, is a very small percentage amount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q4-2023-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2024 Q1","e":"tsm","d":"2024-04-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"C.C. Wei","x":"Several AI processors are narrowly defined as GPUs, AI accelerators and CPU's performing, training, and inference functions and do not include the networking edge or on-device AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q1-2024-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2024 Q1","e":"tsm","d":"2024-04-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gokul Hariharan","x":"And previously, a couple of quarters back, you talked about cannibalization or decline in regular data center demand due to the crowding out of AI and being a drag for TSMC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q1-2024-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2024 Q1","e":"tsm","d":"2024-04-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wendell Huang","x":"After last year's 17% electricity price increase from April 1st, TSMC's electricity price in Taiwan has increased by another 25% starting April 1st this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q1-2024-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2024 Q1","e":"tsm","d":"2024-04-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wendell Huang","x":"After last year's 17% electricity price increase from April 1st, TSMC's electricity price in Taiwan was -- has increased by another 25% starting April 1st this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/18/taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-tsm-q1-2024-ear/"},{"c":"TSM 2024 Q2","e":"tsm","d":"2024-07-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Wendell Huang","x":"As the strong structural AI-related demand continues, we continue to invest to support our customers' growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/18/taiwan-semi